OL,3,GNEWSACity night venues tax axed with
OL,4,Aimmediate effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charge on a city's pubs, bars and
OL,7,Fclubs that funded safety measures has
OL,8,Fbeen scrapped.
OL,10,FNewcastle City Council took the
OL,11,Fdecision to repeal the late night levy
OL,12,Fwith immediate effect at a meeting on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FVenues had been charged an annual fee
OL,16,Fof between #299 and #4,400 and the levy
OL,17,Fhas raised more than #3m since its
OL,18,Fintroduction in 2013.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
