OL,3,GNEWSACity night venues tax axed with
OL,4,Aimmediate effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charge was used to fund safety
OL,7,Fmeasures, but industry leaders called
OL,8,Ffor it to be dropped because of
OL,9,Ffinancial pressures facing the
OL,10,Fhospitality sector. Council leader
OL,11,FColin Ferguson said the tax had placed
OL,12,Fan "unfair burden" on businesses.
